OL,3,ANew Nvidia boss says momentum goes on
OL,4,Aas firm reports bumper results after
OL,5,AHuang quits
OL,6,
OL,7,FNvidia's interim chief executive
OL,8,FCollette Kress said the company's rapid
OL,9,Fgrowth is on track as it topped $100bn
OL,10,Fin quarterly sales for the first time.
OL,12,FIn the company's first results since
OL,13,Fthe dramatic exit of founder Jensen
OL,14,FHuang, Kress said Nvidia's "roadmap is
OL,15,Fon track and our ambition has never
OL,16,Fbeen greater".
OL,18,FThe company's quarterly sales doubled
OL,19,Ffrom a year earlier, reaching $115.8bn
OL,20,F(#86.9bn), with shares in the company
OL,21,Frecovering some recent losses in
OL,22,Fafter-hours trading.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
